[{:db/id "q-72252/selection/b2a2df7aef5fe878774fd18ebaeca96c2086010b0761e754630d226385a0f952" :answer/id #uuid "04d7531a-3dd9-52fd-985a-3fd86ed94c0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{6}+\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{8}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72252/selection/db565c32614270c58cb4ddd28816fe9f4ecaea77569830f8915b625ee94b03e7" :answer/id #uuid "ee51484c-a6a4-5f40-ac70-b492972d1b91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{6}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72252/selection/f4caa32dc7d76743a1f11104926a10c68cd6c2d0a3b451180ce16323a0f74876" :answer/id #uuid "b7eb24a9-f854-5eb4-b75c-5d018fc4d870" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{9}+\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{16}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72252/selection/3aea365e377a725ad10492f1dfdd717777e18f31a5c9b1769e0b625ab0e3d31c" :answer/id #uuid "feeec65c-f199-549e-808b-af504a539680" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{9}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{16}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72252/selection/c128942d5e710897bd134e23ba44e1782b47253e9676104a3d042bbb357f8ad9" :answer/id #uuid "098b131c-f332-585a-ac9c-fc691451a7b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{9}+\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{16}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72252/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3753699b-067a-5d56-8d77-f4bf7a64563d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72252/selection/f4caa32dc7d76743a1f11104926a10c68cd6c2d0a3b451180ce16323a0f74876" :answer-field/choices ["q-72252/selection/b2a2df7aef5fe878774fd18ebaeca96c2086010b0761e754630d226385a0f952" "q-72252/selection/db565c32614270c58cb4ddd28816fe9f4ecaea77569830f8915b625ee94b03e7" "q-72252/selection/f4caa32dc7d76743a1f11104926a10c68cd6c2d0a3b451180ce16323a0f74876" "q-72252/selection/3aea365e377a725ad10492f1dfdd717777e18f31a5c9b1769e0b625ab0e3d31c" "q-72252/selection/c128942d5e710897bd134e23ba44e1782b47253e9676104a3d042bbb357f8ad9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72252" :question/id #uuid "185f98a1-a00c-5fde-987b-3fdb1c0ac8f8" :question/math-academy-id "q-72252" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13971771/assets/28079ead5ebb4649900653172d11c25f3ff489c6b34772094a1ba947c18ef3e1.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the ellipse given above?" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the general equation of an ellipse centered at $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nHere, the ellipse is centered at $(-2,-2),$ the horizontal radius has length $a=3,$ and the vertical radius has length $b=4.$ Therefore, the equation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-(-2))^{2}}{{3}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-(-2))^{2}}{{4}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{9}+\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{16} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-72252/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "57e19ee3-db9a-58d7-8ca3-4e8801aee656"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72252"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115307/selection/2f640d3e9c34ec4171f3b948ab19c01be7220087f7745dd0b7846f8ab146829f" :answer/id #uuid "1935574e-04dd-5f6b-819b-70fd22ed737d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,-4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115307/selection/360fca4011015cc49cdadf6055c61b28b61a631cfedf9ec7e4105462f0fe99b7" :answer/id #uuid "90954fdd-0cca-59c6-b3d6-a9de089d70d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2,8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115307/selection/3daf7c7813fd10d96af0e7397ad761fd8013a7868d9b6c8ad4b2e20ce2d33dca" :answer/id #uuid "f10308e0-6e76-5dad-bc